category: Net
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Thin, simple and robust network layer on top of UDP (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "ENet's purpose is to provide a relatively thin, simple and robust network
communication layer on top of UDP (User Datagram Protocol). The primary
feature it provides is optional reliable, in-order delivery of packets."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/lsalzman/enet
license: MIT
